sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Application
    participant Resolver as Local DNS Resolver
    participant Root as Root DNS Server
    participant TLD as .com TLD Server
    participant Auth as Authoritative DNS Server
    participant MailSrv as Sender MTA (SMTP)
    participant MailRelay as Receiver MTA (SMTP)
    participant Mailbox as Recipient Mailbox (POP3/IMAP)

    Note over Client,Mailbox: Phase 1: DNS Resolution
    Client->>Resolver: Query www.example.com
    Resolver->>Root: Query .com nameservers
    Root-->>Resolver: List of .com TLD servers
    Resolver->>TLD: Query example.com nameservers
    TLD-->>Resolver: List of auth servers for example.com
    Resolver->>Auth: Query www.example.com A record
    Auth-->>Resolver: 93.184.216.34 (with TTL)
    Resolver-->>Client: 93.184.216.34 (cached)

    Note over Client,Mailbox: Phase 2: SMTP Mail Delivery
    Client->>MailSrv: HELO (port 587)
    MailSrv-->>Client: 250 Hello
    Client->>MailSrv: MAIL FROM: alice@example.com
    MailSrv-->>Client: 250 OK
    Client->>MailSrv: RCPT TO: bob@other.org
    MailSrv-->>Client: 250 OK
    Client->>MailSrv: DATA (message body)
    MailSrv-->>Client: 250 OK (queued)
    Note over MailSrv,MailRelay: MX lookup → relay to other.org
    MailSrv->>MailRelay: SMTP transfer over port 25
    MailRelay-->>MailSrv: 250 OK (delivered)
    MailRelay->>Mailbox: Message stored on server
    Client->>Mailbox: Retrieve via POP3/IMAP (port 110/143)
    Mailbox-->>Client: Message delivered

    Note over Client,Mailbox: Phase 3: File Transfer (FTP)
    Client->>+FTPCtrl: FTP Control (port 21)
    FTPCtrl-->>-Client: 220 Ready
    Client->>+FTPCtrl: USER / PASS (authentication)
    FTPCtrl-->>-Client: 230 Login successful
    Client->>+FTPCtrl: PASV (passive mode)
    FTPCtrl-->>-Client: 227 Entering Passive Mode (IP,port)
    Note over Client,FTPData: Data connection (port 20 or PASV port)
    Client->>+FTPData: RETR file.txt
    FTPData-->>-Client: File data transfer
    Client->>+FTPCtrl: QUIT
    FTPCtrl-->>-Client: 221 Goodbye